# Pulsar Stop — wind down the extruder, leave the robot to move home.
#
# Paste after the last bead movej, BEFORE any return-home travel.
# pulsar_pause() halts the screw first (within ~one chunk) so nothing
# extrudes during the home move, then pulsar_stop_extrusion() clears the
# running flag and releases the motor, and pulsar_cooldown() turns the
# heaters off. No popup here — the operator gate lives in the Pulsar End
# block that fires after the robot has parked.

pulsar_pause()
pulsar_stop_extrusion()
pulsar_cooldown()
